@startuml
title Cache-aside with Redis - Sequence (medium)
participant Client
participant "Product API" as API
database "Redis" as Cache
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Read ==
Client -> API : GET /products/42
API -> Cache : GET product:42
alt cache hit
  Cache --> API : product JSON
else cache miss
  Cache --> API : nil
  API -> DB : SELECT * FROM products WHERE id=42
  DB --> API : row
  API -> Cache : SET product:42 EX 300
end
API --> Client : 200 product

== Write ==
Client -> API : PUT /products/42
API -> DB : UPDATE products SET ...
API -> Cache : DEL product:42
note right of Cache : Invalidate, do not update.\nNext read refills cache.
API --> Client : 204 No Content
@enduml
